---
// What is Followbirds Section
---

<section id="what-is-followbirds" class="what-is-followbirds section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">The guide workflow</span>
      <h2>Simple for you. Memorable for guests.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        We are building the essential tools around the moments that make a great birding tour.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="step-number">01</span>
        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Create a tour</h3>
          <p>Set up the route, checklist, and guest details before you leave.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="step-number">02</span>
        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/>
            <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Share observations</h3>
          <p>Record each sighting once while guests follow the same shared experience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="step-number">03</span>
        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Send the follow-up</h3>
          <p>Turn the day into a polished summary guests can revisit and share.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a class="section-link" href="mailto:guides@followbirds.com?subject=Founding%20guide%20program">Apply as a founding guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-is-followbirds {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
    padding: 5.75rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .what-is-followbirds h2 {
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    text-align: left;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(35, 40, 46, 0.32);
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .feature-icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--green-soft);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background 0.25s ease;
  }

  .feature-card:hover .feature-icon-wrap {
    background: var(--green);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .step-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.1rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .section-link {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .section-link span {
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
    transition: margin-left 0.2s ease;
  }

  .section-link:hover span {
    margin-left: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .feature-icon-wrap {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
    }
  }
</style>
